{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20978","headline":"苦昼短 · 李贺","name":"苦昼短","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞光飞光，劝尔一杯酒。\n吾不识青天高，黄地厚。\n唯见月寒日暖，来煎人寿。\n食熊则肥，食蛙则瘦。\n神君何在，太一安有。\n天东有若木，下置衔烛龙。\n吾将斩龙足，嚼龙肉。\n使之朝不得回，夜不得伏。\n自然老者不死，少者不哭。\n何爲服黄金，吞白玉。\n谁似任公子，云中骑碧驴。\n刘彻茂陵多滞骨，嬴政梓棺费鲍鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}